# Optional skip-list for hosting/reconcile/reconcile.sh (RECONCILE_SKIP_FILE).
# One entry per line: the basename of the manifest source to exclude from
# diff+apply -- either a raw hosting/services/*.yaml file, a
# hosting/services/*.values.yaml file (the chart-rendered ones), or the
# literal "clusters/dmon" for the cluster-config phase. # comments and blank
# lines are ignored. Empty by default -- nothing is skipped unless this file
# is populated and pointed to.
#
# Example:
# lynxai.values.yaml
# mason.yaml
